WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:06.080
Netflix, the reigning champion of all streaming&nbsp;
sites, is still many people's go-to when looking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:10.720
for a new film to watch. Whether you want&nbsp;
a classic favorite or a hot new release,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:15.360
the streaming giant has no shortage of&nbsp;
movies for film aficionados to enjoy.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:21.520
This holds especially true for horror fans.&nbsp;
For many, Netflix is the best place for horror&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:26.240
this side of Shudder. Netflix often snags&nbsp;
the distribution rights to some remarkable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:31.360
scary films, giving audiences plenty of&nbsp;
options when they are in search of a fright.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:36.320
We're not even into October yet, and the&nbsp;
service has already provided some of the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:39.680
chilling films of the year already&nbsp;
with the "Fear Street" trilogy and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:43.920
"Army of the Dead." The latest film to&nbsp;
keep you up at night is 2020's "The Old&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:48.560
Ways" — and the suspenseful film has&nbsp;
audiences on the edge of their seats.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:52.000
The film follows Cristina Lopez,&nbsp;
a Mexican-American journalist who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.400
returns to her hometown near Veracruz to&nbsp;
research a story on witchcraft. There,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:00.560
she is kidnapped by a group of locals,&nbsp;
including a bruja, — which means..&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:04.880
Witch, in English —who thinks she’s&nbsp;
possessed by a demon. All the familiar&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:09.200
beats of a classic demon possession movie&nbsp;
are there, but with some sly twists,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:13.840
the film manages to embed itself within your&nbsp;
mind. You can watch the trailer to see if it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:18.560
up your alley as you witness Cristina fighting&nbsp;
for her life — and struggling to know what's real.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:22.880
Right from the opening scene, you know&nbsp;
you're in for a terrifying time. We get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:27.520
the chance to see an exorcism in action,&nbsp;
and immediately after that, we see a woman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:33.120
with a bag over her head. You wind up being&nbsp;
just as confused and terrified as Cristina,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:38.640
and that's when the big revelation takes place.&nbsp;
Her cousin, Miranda, and some of the townsfolk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:43.040
want to keep her restrained until they have an&nbsp;
opportunity to remove the demon inside of her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:48.640
Cristina may abide by modern sensibilities,&nbsp;
but in this town, they adhere to the old ways.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:54.000
The movie scored a fairly impressive 100%&nbsp;
Tomatometer rating on Rotten Tomatoes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:59.760
Michelle Swope of Dread Central praises the film&nbsp;
for its "wicked practical effects," and how it,

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:06.080
"Uses body horror as a way to represent Cristina's&nbsp;
inner demons and her refusal to deal with them."

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:08.960
Over at The Upcoming, Andrew Murray calls it

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:12.640
"A highly entertaining new&nbsp;
spin on the exorcism genre."

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:16.480
"The Old Ways" is more than just your&nbsp;
average horror film though; the film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:20.960
explores complex themes such as addiction,&nbsp;
feeling like a stranger in your hometown,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:26.720
and loss of culture. The movie also highlights&nbsp;
the unshakeable bond of family. In particular,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:29.760
Kat Hughes of The Hollywood News&nbsp;
remarks on the film's exploration&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:34.400
of the relationship between the captured&nbsp;
Cristina and her estranged cousin, saying,

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:39.200
"Watching these women attempt to reconnect,&nbsp;
especially under extreme conditions,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:45.040
adds a necessary layer of warmth to what could&nbsp;
be just another heartless and cold horror."

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:50.640
The perfect mix of body horror, exorcism,&nbsp;
family drama, and thrilling suspense,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:54.320
"The Old Ways" is a must-watch&nbsp;
— now streaming on Netflix.

